WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 35]

01:34.520 --> 01:37.010
[One Heaven Knack]
Do all masters give out such precious gifts?

01:38.080 --> 01:40.039
You're Ye Qingmei's son after all.

01:40.879 --> 01:42.099
My teacher said

01:42.119 --> 01:44.340
that this knack belonged to your mother
in the first place.

01:44.360 --> 01:46.800
Now, he's just returning it
to its rightful owner.

01:48.480 --> 01:49.960
My mother was everywhere, huh?

01:50.879 --> 01:52.160
It's because you're lucky.

01:52.879 --> 01:54.930
I have to thank you
for what you did just now.

01:54.950 --> 01:56.540
You don't need to thank me for that.

01:56.560 --> 01:57.759
Shadow, who was hiding in the water,

01:57.759 --> 01:59.360
was your trump card.

02:00.879 --> 02:03.119
Did you know Yun Zhilan
was coming from the start?

02:03.319 --> 02:04.659
Forget about Yun Zhilan.

02:04.679 --> 02:06.620
I didn't even know
that Shadow was in Jiangnan.

02:06.640 --> 02:07.839
You didn't know?

02:08.719 --> 02:10.120
That's strange.

02:10.190 --> 02:12.659
It's too much of a coincidence
for him to hide in that position.

02:12.679 --> 02:15.440
I think someone leaked your secret
no matter how I look at it.

02:16.040 --> 02:16.979
I have no idea.

02:16.999 --> 02:18.400
I'm more perplexed than you.

02:18.750 --> 02:20.380
Forget it. It's none of my business.

02:23.200 --> 02:24.280
Eat up.

02:27.560 --> 02:29.600
How have you been doing
after your marriage?

02:31.750 --> 02:33.150
I've been doing pretty well.

02:34.880 --> 02:36.199
I can rest at ease, then.

02:38.999 --> 02:40.639
Si Lili told me to ask you that.

02:43.600 --> 02:44.959
How is she, then?

02:45.030 --> 02:46.290
Don't even ask about it.

02:46.360 --> 02:46.880
Who's Si Lili?

02:46.880 --> 02:48.659
If you stop caring about her,

02:48.679 --> 02:50.430
that'll be her biggest consolation.

02:53.880 --> 02:54.800
You should try to tell

02:54.800 --> 02:56.920
if this is duck or goose.

02:56.930 --> 02:57.679
Don't you know this dish?

02:57.679 --> 02:59.239
I'm referring to this.

03:00.519 --> 03:01.919
Isn't this chicken?

03:03.080 --> 03:04.919
This is boiled chicken with salt, right?

03:21.719 --> 03:22.480
Enough already.

03:22.480 --> 03:24.259
Slow down.

03:24.279 --> 03:25.740
You might fall.

03:25.760 --> 03:26.580
Okay.

03:26.600 --> 03:27.759
Stop running.

03:33.279 --> 03:35.639
Mother, Mr. Fan has arrived.

03:38.959 --> 03:41.000
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

03:41.119 --> 03:44.160
I should receive him outside.

03:45.519 --> 03:47.900
Mr. Fan, did you come here alone?

03:47.920 --> 03:49.680
No matter how chaotic Jiangnan is,

03:50.010 --> 03:52.239
the Ming's Residence
is at least a safe place, right?

03:53.360 --> 03:55.800
The Ming family will protect you
with our lives, Mr. Fan.

03:57.719 --> 03:59.680
Hurry and greet Mr. Fan.

04:00.160 --> 04:03.720
Mr. Fan.

04:03.850 --> 04:05.330
Be good, okay?
I forgot to bring some candies.

04:05.340 --> 04:06.819
I'll bring them here next time.

04:06.839 --> 04:07.919
Go now.

04:13.719 --> 04:14.799
Mother,

04:15.160 --> 04:17.120
are you not done yet?

04:18.239 --> 04:20.680
The ceremony will be over
after he kowtows to me.

04:23.160 --> 04:24.480
Mr. Fan, please have a seat.

04:24.520 --> 04:26.079
I'll chat with you for now.

04:32.400 --> 04:33.800
What are you guys doing?

04:35.679 --> 04:37.150
This is an adoption ceremony.

04:37.360 --> 04:38.440
Adoption?

04:38.520 --> 04:39.600
That's right.

04:39.960 --> 04:41.360
He's from the same clan as me.

04:41.800 --> 04:44.639
He can be considered my cousin.

04:45.319 --> 04:48.000
After my mother adopts him,

04:48.559 --> 04:52.240
he'll become my brother instead.

04:52.520 --> 04:53.800
We'll be closer.

04:53.879 --> 04:55.560
He's lucky as well.

04:55.820 --> 04:57.370
Mr. Fan, you're observing
his adoption process.

04:57.380 --> 04:58.580
It'll bring glory to our ancestors

04:58.600 --> 05:00.040
if we spread word about it.

05:01.520 --> 05:02.760
Please have some tea.

05:08.079 --> 05:09.480
Enough already.

05:09.800 --> 05:12.199
The ceremony is over. Stop it.

05:12.679 --> 05:13.580
Come.

05:13.600 --> 05:14.920
Come, get up.

05:15.439 --> 05:16.219
Come on.

05:16.239 --> 05:17.360
Take this.

05:20.199 --> 05:21.780
From now on,

05:21.800 --> 05:23.619
you and I are brothers.

05:23.639 --> 05:25.340
As your elder brother,

05:25.360 --> 05:27.360
I should show you some appreciation.

05:30.480 --> 05:32.179
I'm getting old now.

05:32.199 --> 05:34.320
I'm not as thoughtful as you.

05:35.350 --> 05:36.880
These are just trivial affairs.

05:37.319 --> 05:38.870
Mother, if you have to worry about that,

05:38.890 --> 05:41.240
my position as the head of the family
would be worthless.

05:41.679 --> 05:44.079
Look. Mother has already spoken.

05:45.400 --> 05:46.880
Hurry and take it.

05:47.030 --> 05:49.040
I've prepared them
for your children as well.

05:51.639 --> 05:52.550
Come.

05:52.570 --> 05:53.999
Children, you guys
will receive them as well.

05:53.999 --> 05:54.050
Come on.

05:54.050 --> 05:55.199
Come on.

05:56.360 --> 05:57.440
Go now.

06:00.960 --> 06:01.639
From now on,

06:01.639 --> 06:03.440
I'll be your eldest uncle.

06:03.639 --> 06:05.410
In the future, I'm in charge here.

06:05.430 --> 06:06.380
I make the call here.

06:06.400 --> 06:07.500
Did you guys hear me?

06:07.520 --> 06:08.759
Come, each of you will get one.

06:08.759 --> 06:09.820
Thank you, First Uncle.

06:09.840 --> 06:11.159
Thank you, First Uncle.

06:11.239 --> 06:12.140
Thank you, First Uncle.

06:12.160 --> 06:13.440
Go and buy some candies.

06:13.800 --> 06:14.880
Go now.

06:19.720 --> 06:20.800
Mother,

06:21.010 --> 06:22.760
our family affair has been resolved.

06:23.230 --> 06:24.680
We should get to business.

06:24.840 --> 06:26.480
You're the head of the family.

06:27.040 --> 06:28.599
You may make the call here.

06:31.319 --> 06:32.519
Mr. Fan,

06:32.840 --> 06:34.120
please have a seat.

06:45.559 --> 06:46.920
Why are you still kneeling

06:46.920 --> 06:48.320
when the ceremony is over?

06:49.319 --> 06:50.539
Mr. Fan, I made you a promise

06:50.559 --> 06:53.120
at the pier today.

06:53.319 --> 06:54.639
I promised

06:55.230 --> 06:56.800
that I would give you an account.

07:10.439 --> 07:11.519
Mr. Fan,

07:11.759 --> 07:14.580
this is the greedy culprit

07:14.600 --> 07:16.480
who issued the bounty on you in secret.

07:27.800 --> 07:28.920
It's him?

07:30.480 --> 07:31.680
He's the culprit?

07:32.890 --> 07:36.279
Didn't he just turn into your brother?
He was your cousin before.

07:36.480 --> 07:37.500
What's his motive?

07:37.520 --> 07:38.239
He's greedy?

07:38.240 --> 07:40.370
It's likely that this is
his proof of allegiance.

07:40.759 --> 07:41.820
Mr. Fan, you came to the South

07:41.840 --> 07:43.810
and jeopardized
someone else's interests.

07:43.920 --> 07:45.719
He might just be a pawn.

07:48.280 --> 07:49.720
Did I jeopardize
the Ming family's interest?

07:49.720 --> 07:51.399
The Ming family doesn't deserve it.

07:51.879 --> 07:52.959
Mr. Fan,

07:53.199 --> 07:55.560
the Three Great Workshops
belong to the imperial family.

07:55.639 --> 07:59.759
We're just managing them
on their behalf.

08:00.239 --> 08:01.619
All of the machines

08:01.639 --> 08:03.000
and personnel

08:03.160 --> 08:04.940
were supervised by
the Transportation Bureau.

08:04.960 --> 08:06.340
Even if trades were done,

08:06.360 --> 08:09.830
the money still had to be handed
to Eldest Princess and Second Prince.

08:09.999 --> 08:11.500
To put it bluntly,

08:11.520 --> 08:14.599
the Ming family
is just a group of watchdogs.

08:14.759 --> 08:16.959
To us, it doesn't matter

08:17.720 --> 08:19.140
who makes the call here.

08:19.160 --> 08:20.219
Don't you agree?

08:20.239 --> 08:21.299
Dogs do bite people.

08:21.319 --> 08:22.680
Only wild dogs bite people.

08:22.720 --> 08:25.159
The important thing about watchdogs

08:26.110 --> 08:27.360
is that they're loyal.

08:34.400 --> 08:35.419
What about this?

08:35.439 --> 08:36.519
Mr. Fan,

08:36.719 --> 08:40.520
I'll express a stand
on the Ming family's behalf.

08:41.880 --> 08:43.659
Mr. Fan, you came to the South
to reclaim the workshops

08:43.679 --> 08:44.999
under imperial order.

08:45.120 --> 08:47.130
The Ming family will
do our best to help you

08:47.150 --> 08:48.839
reclaim the Three Great Workshops.

08:51.359 --> 08:52.960
What the head of the family says

08:53.120 --> 08:54.999
represents the stand of the Ming family.

09:05.959 --> 09:07.760
All right.

09:10.000 --> 09:11.760
Now that you've given me an account

09:12.199 --> 09:14.359
and had expressed your stand,

09:15.359 --> 09:16.920
what should we do with him?

09:17.870 --> 09:20.740
He issued a private bounty in an attempt
to assassinate government officials.

09:20.760 --> 09:21.960
He shall be executed.

09:47.839 --> 09:49.040
Mr. Fan,

09:49.959 --> 09:52.400
the Ming family
never practices favoritism.

09:53.520 --> 09:55.320
Mr. Fan, please deal

09:57.160 --> 09:58.520
with the culprit.

10:01.479 --> 10:03.920
You guys should at least
let the children leave first.

10:03.920 --> 10:05.560
They're watching, you know?

10:21.079 --> 10:22.380
Since he was the culprit,

10:22.400 --> 10:23.939
why did you adopt him?

10:23.959 --> 10:25.879
Although he's supposed to be executed,

10:26.479 --> 10:28.839
his children are innocent.

10:29.280 --> 10:30.900
Once I adopted him,

10:30.920 --> 10:32.520
I could raise these children

10:33.160 --> 10:34.659
like my own grandchildren

10:34.679 --> 10:37.920
after his death.

10:39.479 --> 10:42.400
If so, he can die in peace.

10:43.000 --> 10:44.760
Mother, you're benevolent.

10:44.880 --> 10:46.239
If I were him,

10:47.520 --> 10:48.999
I'm sure I could die in peace.

10:49.120 --> 10:50.400
Mr. Fan,

10:52.199 --> 10:53.279
please.

11:05.510 --> 11:06.579
This is the culprit?

11:06.599 --> 11:07.760
Indeed.

11:08.240 --> 11:09.680
He's blinded by greed?

11:09.719 --> 11:10.799
That's right.

11:11.400 --> 11:12.659
Do you confess your crime?

11:12.679 --> 11:13.620
I do.

11:13.640 --> 11:15.459
You'll be executed, you know?

11:15.479 --> 11:17.320
Mr. Fan, please go ahead!

11:18.920 --> 11:20.760
I won't!

11:20.780 --> 11:21.750
I will investigate the case

11:21.760 --> 11:22.900
before I execute you.

11:22.920 --> 11:24.040
Take him to the yamen.

11:24.050 --> 11:25.560
Interrogate him thoroughly.

11:34.920 --> 11:36.040
Qingda,

11:36.599 --> 11:39.079
can you please make my children leave?

11:44.719 --> 11:46.370
Focus on the case

11:46.390 --> 11:48.199
and cooperate with the investigation.

11:48.719 --> 11:50.560
Don't worry about the family.

11:50.839 --> 11:53.320
I'll take care of the children
on your behalf.

11:53.920 --> 11:55.800
They'll be fine.

12:00.679 --> 12:01.999
Someone.

12:12.280 --> 12:13.599
Escort him to the yamen.

12:21.800 --> 12:23.160
Mr. Fan, be careful!

12:38.559 --> 12:39.639
This...

12:40.320 --> 12:42.320
So, he killed himself
to escape from his crime.

12:43.439 --> 12:45.440
Mr. Fan, are you okay?

12:45.599 --> 12:47.339
Did you get any blood on your shirt?

12:47.359 --> 12:48.719
You blocked all of it.

12:48.719 --> 12:50.310
Why should there be any blood on me?

12:56.199 --> 12:57.279
This...

12:57.479 --> 12:58.970
If I can't wash it off,

12:58.990 --> 12:59.830
I have to throw it away

12:59.850 --> 13:01.260
and get some new clothes.

13:01.760 --> 13:03.059
What a waste.

13:03.079 --> 13:04.160
Look.

13:04.280 --> 13:06.040
The dishes were nice too.

13:08.200 --> 13:09.359
Mr. Fan,

13:09.559 --> 13:10.920
so, will you

13:11.400 --> 13:12.800
bring the body back?

13:13.959 --> 13:15.659
He already took his own life.

13:15.679 --> 13:17.520
Do you think I can interrogate a body?

13:18.599 --> 13:20.239
If that's the case,

13:20.559 --> 13:23.419
I'll take his body out of the residence

13:23.439 --> 13:24.839
and bury it.

13:25.079 --> 13:26.560
I'll be back in a second.

13:43.760 --> 13:44.879
Mr. Fan,

13:46.400 --> 13:49.699
you gathered funds to send
the disaster victims home.

13:49.719 --> 13:51.359
That was truly impressive.

13:51.599 --> 13:53.320
The Ming family

13:53.599 --> 13:56.959
can't afford to lag behind.

13:57.679 --> 13:59.199
We can talk about that later.

13:59.199 --> 14:01.239
There's still blood here.

14:33.040 --> 14:34.239
Folks,

14:34.719 --> 14:35.879
I've already said

14:36.160 --> 14:37.359
what I had to say.

14:38.800 --> 14:40.459
The Ming family are doing good deeds,

14:40.479 --> 14:41.920
and there's no time to waste.

14:43.079 --> 14:45.199
Bottoms up.

14:45.640 --> 14:46.720
Bottoms up.

14:47.839 --> 14:48.920
Mr. Ming!

14:53.319 --> 14:54.399
Mr. Ming.

14:57.319 --> 15:00.280
Did all these folks come to serve us
of their own accord?

15:01.079 --> 15:02.159
That's right.

15:03.240 --> 15:05.780
Why do most of them look familiar?

15:05.800 --> 15:07.980
All of them are doing this
for the Ming family's sake.

15:09.640 --> 15:11.579
Mister, please have a seat.

15:11.599 --> 15:12.760
Thank you, Mr. Ming.

15:14.719 --> 15:15.920
It must've been tough.

15:36.640 --> 15:37.879
I, Ming Qingda,

15:38.880 --> 15:40.160
will thank all of you

15:45.439 --> 15:47.400
on the Ming family's behalf.

16:36.240 --> 16:37.800
Bonds are built based on trust.

16:40.400 --> 16:41.680
Dear folks,

16:43.160 --> 16:45.280
the Ming family will keep their word.

16:54.810 --> 16:56.530
After finishing this bowl of liquor,

17:00.640 --> 17:02.520
your family members

17:03.359 --> 17:05.280
will be our family members.

17:06.040 --> 17:07.720
I dare not make other promises.

17:07.919 --> 17:10.070
However, as long as
the Ming family is still around,

17:10.440 --> 17:13.879
I'll make sure
they can live comfortably!

17:26.359 --> 17:27.480
Folks,

17:28.839 --> 17:30.439
see you in the next life!

17:32.720 --> 17:34.899
Thank you, Mr. Ming!

17:34.919 --> 17:38.359
Mr. Ming is our benefactor!

17:45.639 --> 17:47.119
I have plenty of words to say.

17:48.910 --> 17:50.870
However,
the auspicious hour has arrived.

17:52.599 --> 17:53.679
Guys,

17:58.319 --> 17:59.760
farewell!

18:18.040 --> 18:21.020
Mr. Fan, I'm sure
you think it's clean now.

18:21.040 --> 18:23.300
You guys were accustomed to the process.

18:23.320 --> 18:25.480
I'm sure plenty of people
died in your family, huh?

18:25.800 --> 18:27.220
It's a huge family.

18:27.240 --> 18:29.660
People live and die every day.

18:29.680 --> 18:31.240
We're already used to it.

19:02.240 --> 19:03.800
Don't get the number wrong.

19:04.319 --> 19:05.439
Mr. Ming, don't worry.

19:05.480 --> 19:07.059
Including the one you brought back,

19:07.079 --> 19:08.839
the number is just right.

19:09.010 --> 19:11.030
Have you made
the subsequent arrangements?

19:11.119 --> 19:12.299
I have.

19:12.319 --> 19:14.170
They did it of their own accord.

19:14.190 --> 19:16.260
Many people would've tried to
take their lives as well

19:16.280 --> 19:17.819
had it not been for the limited slots.

19:17.839 --> 19:20.819
After all, once their family members
are taken in by the Ming family,

19:20.839 --> 19:22.299
their fates will change.

19:22.319 --> 19:24.000
It's something unimaginable.

19:25.150 --> 19:27.200
Hurry and transport
the bodies onto the carts.

19:27.399 --> 19:28.760
Time waits for no one.

19:28.840 --> 19:31.359
Yes. We'll deliver them
to the Transportation Bureau now.

19:45.119 --> 19:46.359
We've sinned.

19:53.280 --> 19:54.480
Make haste.

19:55.280 --> 19:56.439
Be quick.

20:34.119 --> 20:37.280
Mr. Xie, were you looking for me?

20:37.350 --> 20:38.679
I wasn't looking for you.

20:47.000 --> 20:48.139
Mr. Xie,

20:48.159 --> 20:50.930
you need to open the windows more often

20:50.950 --> 20:52.630
so that it has better ventilation.

20:55.639 --> 20:57.639
Mr. Xie, have a seat.

21:03.319 --> 21:04.399
Please.

21:11.320 --> 21:12.960
I heard that Fan Xian has arrived.

21:15.960 --> 21:17.040
That's right.

21:19.000 --> 21:20.520
The old madam

21:20.639 --> 21:22.399
insisted on giving him an account.

21:22.599 --> 21:25.139
She said the Ming family
might be wiped out

21:25.159 --> 21:26.800
if we don't resolve the issue

21:27.280 --> 21:30.180
with the bounty soon.

21:30.200 --> 21:31.180
Mr. Xie,

21:31.200 --> 21:32.379
to be honest,

21:32.399 --> 21:34.159
I already tried to persuade her.

21:34.480 --> 21:36.399
On the surface,
I'm the head of the family.

21:38.720 --> 21:41.560
But in reality, I'm insignificant.

21:43.000 --> 21:44.439
My mother makes the call

21:45.399 --> 21:47.159
for everything.

21:47.240 --> 21:48.639
Your mother

21:48.919 --> 21:50.439
was right though.

21:50.639 --> 21:52.599
Mr. Xie, I beg to differ.

21:52.680 --> 21:55.119
We should be honest and upright.

21:55.359 --> 21:57.119
How could we be indecisive?

21:58.960 --> 21:59.859
Since the Ming family

21:59.879 --> 22:03.200
has decided to side
with Eldest Princess and Second Prince,

22:03.559 --> 22:05.859
we mustn't interact with Fan Xian often.

22:05.879 --> 22:07.339
We have to avoid suspicion.

22:07.359 --> 22:09.539
Mr. Ming, I'm glad you understand that.

22:09.559 --> 22:10.919
I never forgot about it.

22:12.280 --> 22:13.560
Mr. Xie, don't worry.

22:13.919 --> 22:15.520
The Ming family

22:16.119 --> 22:17.839
is just making him empty promises.

22:19.280 --> 22:20.839
With my strong personality,

22:21.159 --> 22:23.339
even if he does annihilate
the Ming family,

22:23.359 --> 22:25.079
I won't let him off either.

22:26.639 --> 22:28.359
There's no need to worry too much.

22:28.639 --> 22:30.000
I'll tell you something.

22:30.559 --> 22:31.800
Fan Xian will die

22:32.119 --> 22:33.539
in two days.

22:33.559 --> 22:34.839
In two days?

22:38.680 --> 22:40.040
What does that mean?

22:40.200 --> 22:41.980
The Eldest Princess
will be paying us a visit.

22:42.000 --> 22:43.679
The deed will definitely be done.

22:49.359 --> 22:50.639
If so,

22:52.200 --> 22:53.879
who will kill Fan Xian?

22:54.119 --> 22:55.280
Don't ask too much.

22:55.800 --> 22:57.170
Just wait for the result.

22:58.000 --> 22:59.960
Understood.

23:02.119 --> 23:03.520
I can rest at ease

23:03.839 --> 23:05.399
after hearing that.

23:14.599 --> 23:18.119
The head of the family
was inconsiderate indeed.

23:18.839 --> 23:20.839
Someone just died.

23:21.359 --> 23:23.679
Mr. Fan, I'm sure
you don't have any appetite.

23:23.960 --> 23:27.280
This area is quieter.

23:28.119 --> 23:29.339
Mr. Fan, you gathered funds

23:29.359 --> 23:31.200
to perform good deeds.

23:31.559 --> 23:33.660
No matter how tough it is
for the Ming family,

23:33.680 --> 23:36.059
we're willing to donate 200,000 taels

23:36.079 --> 23:37.679
to your cause.

23:39.119 --> 23:40.859
So, the top family in Jiangnan

23:40.879 --> 23:42.059
is facing issues as well?

23:42.079 --> 23:43.560
Mr. Fan, to be honest,

23:44.200 --> 23:46.980
Eldest Princess requested us

23:47.000 --> 23:49.940
to be sales agents
of the Three Great Workshops.

23:49.960 --> 23:51.720
We incur losses all year long.

23:52.399 --> 23:53.780
The Ming family

23:53.800 --> 23:56.119
has to fill the hole with our own money.

23:56.599 --> 24:00.119
The Three Great Workshops
already monopolized the related market.

24:00.180 --> 24:02.180
Even so, you guys
are still incurring losses?

24:02.200 --> 24:03.220
Monopolized?

24:03.240 --> 24:04.619
That means

24:04.639 --> 24:07.320
you have sole ownership
of the craft secret.

24:10.079 --> 24:11.480
It's just

24:12.040 --> 24:14.379
that there are too many
unscrupulous merchants in the world.

24:14.399 --> 24:16.139
It's hard to negotiate a good price.

24:16.159 --> 24:18.660
The sources of the goods
are getting more and more expensive.

24:18.680 --> 24:20.320
Moreover...

24:23.280 --> 24:24.720
You guys may leave.

24:36.280 --> 24:38.800
Moreover, the money
will go through Eldest Princess's hands

24:39.599 --> 24:42.760
before it enters the vault.

24:42.919 --> 24:45.679
Therefore, the deficit
of the Imperial Treasury

24:46.440 --> 24:48.200
is unavoidable.

24:48.800 --> 24:50.960
Old Madam Ming, are you saying

24:51.720 --> 24:54.240
that Eldest Princess
took a cut from the profit?

24:54.319 --> 24:56.500
I didn't say that.

24:56.520 --> 24:57.500
Understood.

24:57.520 --> 24:58.690
You said nothing.

24:58.710 --> 25:00.280
I came to that conclusion myself.

25:03.200 --> 25:05.399
Mr. Fan, luckily, you're here.

25:05.680 --> 25:08.879
There's hope
for the Three Great Workshops now.

25:09.440 --> 25:10.280
I thought you guys

25:10.280 --> 25:12.859
would help Li Yunrui to stop me.

25:12.879 --> 25:13.500
Would you?

25:13.520 --> 25:15.520
Mr. Fan, why would you say that?

25:15.639 --> 25:18.520
The Ming family doesn't own
the Three Great Workshops.

25:19.440 --> 25:20.940
To us, it's the same

25:20.960 --> 25:23.780
no matter who owns them.

25:23.800 --> 25:25.859
Mr. Fan, I'm sure you want
to avoid prolonged issues

25:25.879 --> 25:27.919
during your trip to Jiangnan.

25:28.240 --> 25:29.059
Tomorrow,

25:29.079 --> 25:32.500
I'll tell Qingda to bring you
to the Transportation Bureau

25:32.520 --> 25:34.159
and finish the handover.

25:34.240 --> 25:36.539
Mr. Fan, once you take over

25:36.559 --> 25:38.579
the Three Great Workshops officially,

25:38.599 --> 25:40.339
there'll be no cause for concern.

25:40.359 --> 25:41.480
Tell me.

25:41.879 --> 25:43.320
What do you guys desire?

25:45.559 --> 25:47.839
The Three Great Workshops
are in Jiangnan.

25:48.200 --> 25:50.240
Someone has to manage them somehow.

25:52.240 --> 25:55.000
Mr. Fan, what do you think?

25:58.359 --> 25:59.760
Interesting.

26:00.879 --> 26:03.679
The business has been
losing money year after year.

26:03.720 --> 26:06.040
Even so, you guys
still want to manage it, huh?

26:07.639 --> 26:09.159
We're serving the state here.

26:11.159 --> 26:13.919
Personal losses don't matter.

26:14.319 --> 26:16.200
I'm sure luck alone didn't take you guys

26:16.240 --> 26:17.839
to where you guys are right now.

26:19.760 --> 26:21.800
It's all thanks
to the prosperity of the nation

26:22.119 --> 26:24.760
and your blessing, Mr. Fan.

26:44.399 --> 26:45.720
Excellent tea.

26:46.599 --> 26:47.839
This tea is excellent.

26:58.119 --> 26:59.090
Why are you still here?

26:59.110 --> 27:01.100
Don't you think
Fan Xian will get impatient?

27:07.240 --> 27:10.079
Mr. Fan is just a figurehead.

27:10.319 --> 27:11.500
I can just brush him off.

27:11.520 --> 27:12.839
Moreover,

27:13.119 --> 27:14.399
my mother is around.

27:16.000 --> 27:17.439
Everything will be fine.

27:23.359 --> 27:24.439
Mr. Xie,

27:24.720 --> 27:26.070
please have some tea.

27:43.000 --> 27:44.159
What's going on?

27:54.760 --> 27:55.840
This...

27:56.240 --> 27:57.940
What's going on?

27:57.960 --> 27:59.760
The sky is turning red from the fire.

27:59.800 --> 28:01.240
Can't you tell?

28:09.599 --> 28:12.200
Is there a fire?

28:14.200 --> 28:15.359
Mr. Fan!

28:15.599 --> 28:16.339
Mr. Fan!

28:16.359 --> 28:17.439
This...

28:18.119 --> 28:19.280
Mr. Fan!

28:20.000 --> 28:21.280
We're in huge trouble.

28:21.359 --> 28:22.879
I already sent my men there.

28:23.040 --> 28:25.160
I think
the Transportation Bureau is on fire.

28:25.180 --> 28:26.820
You mean the
Imperial Treasury Transportation Bureau?

28:26.839 --> 28:27.919
Indeed.

28:28.040 --> 28:30.439
All the machines and personnel

28:30.680 --> 28:32.359
of the Three Great Workshops

28:32.430 --> 28:34.159
are in the Transportation Bureau.

28:34.520 --> 28:35.879
But Mr. Fan, don't worry.

28:36.040 --> 28:37.480
I already sent my men

28:37.559 --> 28:40.839
to put out the fire before coming here.

28:42.680 --> 28:44.839
Mr. Ming, who do you think set the fire?

28:46.559 --> 28:47.639
This...

28:48.910 --> 28:50.800
This can't be
a man-made incident, right?

28:51.119 --> 28:52.280
After all,

28:52.879 --> 28:56.240
no one will benefit
from the burning of the bureau.

28:59.440 --> 29:02.280
Luckily, I'm here tonight.

29:03.159 --> 29:05.420
If not, I would've suspected you guys
to be the culprits.

29:05.440 --> 29:06.679
Mr. Fan,

29:06.879 --> 29:08.660
the Ming family
will never be bold enough

29:08.680 --> 29:09.599
to do such a thing...

29:09.599 --> 29:10.819
I know that.

29:10.839 --> 29:12.919
Of course it's not the Ming family.

29:13.319 --> 29:15.399
After all, I'm a witness.

29:19.200 --> 29:20.280
Wait.

29:20.559 --> 29:23.000
I can't say that
for the entire Ming family.

29:23.079 --> 29:24.599
After all, your family is huge.

29:24.600 --> 29:26.270
People live and die every day, right?

29:28.399 --> 29:31.260
However, at least
both you and Mr. Ming are innocent,

29:31.280 --> 29:32.919
Old Madam Ming.

29:37.200 --> 29:38.879
I swear upon my credibility

29:39.159 --> 29:43.040
that I'll assist you
with the investigation, Mr. Fan.

29:43.440 --> 29:44.980
The fire is so huge

29:45.000 --> 29:46.679
that it's turning the sky bright.

30:07.040 --> 30:09.720
Baoyue Pleasure House
is no longer a brothel.

30:09.919 --> 30:12.000
Why is Sir still
maintaining its operation?

30:12.520 --> 30:14.359
Sir has better insight than us.

30:15.119 --> 30:16.379
Sir didn't tell us

30:16.399 --> 30:18.520
how he would make arrangements
for these girls.

30:19.159 --> 30:20.240
He didn't say so.

30:20.520 --> 30:23.359
I think he'll make the arrangements
after taking over the workshops.

30:24.960 --> 30:26.460
I assume you must've heard about

30:26.480 --> 30:27.639
the fire last night.

30:28.560 --> 30:30.220
The Transportation Bureau
was reduced to ashes.

30:30.240 --> 30:32.000
The Three Great Workshops are gone.

30:32.359 --> 30:33.780
Of all the times to be burned down,

30:33.800 --> 30:35.880
it just has to be the time
when Sir visits Jiangnan, huh?

30:35.900 --> 30:37.890
Now that
the Three Great Workshops are gone,

30:37.919 --> 30:39.920
the Imperial Treasury
won't be able to last.

30:40.079 --> 30:41.720
This is too much of a coincidence.

30:44.040 --> 30:45.320
I don't believe

30:45.559 --> 30:47.000
that this is a coincidence.

31:02.520 --> 31:03.460
And,

31:03.480 --> 31:06.200
Yuan Meng was found in Jiangnan.

31:06.280 --> 31:07.760
Aren't we going to arrest her?

31:08.119 --> 31:09.639
Sir has his own arrangements.

31:11.319 --> 31:12.760
He's hard to figure out.

31:12.760 --> 31:16.645
[Baoyue Pleasure House]

31:25.839 --> 31:26.740
Mr. Fan,

31:26.760 --> 31:28.079
I've returned.

31:28.319 --> 31:29.379
That was inauspicious.

31:29.399 --> 31:31.000
I inspected

31:31.319 --> 31:32.520
the rubble.

31:32.599 --> 31:34.839
The warehouses
of the Three Great Workshops

31:35.079 --> 31:36.099
were burned down.

31:36.119 --> 31:37.539
Nothing was left.

31:37.559 --> 31:39.079
As for the cause of fire,

31:39.119 --> 31:40.200
it's hard to say.

31:44.000 --> 31:45.139
What about the people?

31:45.159 --> 31:46.399
All of them are dead.

31:46.839 --> 31:48.059
However, I've calculated the number

31:48.079 --> 31:49.020
of bodies.

31:49.040 --> 31:51.780
It matches the number of personnel
in the Three Great Workshops.

31:51.800 --> 31:53.200
The number is the same.

31:53.800 --> 31:56.960
In other words, none of them survived.

31:57.440 --> 31:58.539
I've inspected the bodies

31:58.559 --> 31:59.839
as well.

31:59.960 --> 32:02.679
I think something's off.

32:03.399 --> 32:05.260
I inspected two bodies in total.

32:05.280 --> 32:06.700
There was no dust or ash

32:06.720 --> 32:08.059
in their throats.

32:08.079 --> 32:08.980
That means

32:09.000 --> 32:11.070
the place was burned down
after their deaths.

32:14.960 --> 32:17.399
However, I was worried
that I might alert the perpetrator.

32:17.639 --> 32:19.379
That's why I only inspected two bodies.

32:19.399 --> 32:20.500
This fire

32:20.520 --> 32:22.240
is definitely not an accident.

32:22.919 --> 32:24.539
Do you have any concrete leads?

32:24.559 --> 32:25.680
The fire burned everything down.

32:25.680 --> 32:26.980
Nothing was left.

32:27.000 --> 32:28.240
There were no clues.

32:28.680 --> 32:31.720
What do you think
the Three Great Workshops represent?

32:32.520 --> 32:33.839
The Imperial Treasury

32:34.240 --> 32:35.320
and

32:35.480 --> 32:36.960
countless wealth.

32:37.000 --> 32:39.720
If so, who'll benefit
from burning down the workshops?

32:39.839 --> 32:41.359
I guess

32:43.680 --> 32:45.040
no one.

32:46.119 --> 32:48.020
Therefore, this fire

32:48.040 --> 32:51.040
only burned down
the Three Great Workshops in name.

32:52.680 --> 32:54.200
Are you saying

32:54.480 --> 32:56.520
that there's more to it
than meets the eye?

32:57.240 --> 32:58.940
Wang, you have to guard the back door.

32:58.960 --> 33:01.000
If there's something off about the fire,

33:01.079 --> 33:02.240
we should

33:02.599 --> 33:04.560
receive news of it soon.

33:09.119 --> 33:10.320
I'll head there now.

33:22.079 --> 33:23.700
Fan Xian never left his residence

33:23.720 --> 33:25.040
after he went back.

33:25.079 --> 33:26.399
He didn't do anything.

33:27.159 --> 33:28.119
Where is he staying?

33:28.119 --> 33:29.440
Baoyue Pleasure House.

33:30.079 --> 33:31.980
You mean the brothel in the Capital?

33:32.000 --> 33:35.200
Yes, it's their branch in Jiangnan.

33:35.879 --> 33:37.839
I've never been there before.

33:37.960 --> 33:39.839
I've only heard of it before.

33:42.399 --> 33:45.299
Although Mr. Fan may
look like a righteous person,

33:45.319 --> 33:48.040
he still couldn't escape
from the worldly desires.

33:48.720 --> 33:50.260
I thought

33:50.280 --> 33:53.619
he would go all out
to investigate the fire.

33:53.639 --> 33:54.940
This fire

33:54.960 --> 33:57.510
has burned everything down.

33:57.530 --> 33:59.240
Even if he intends to investigate it,

33:59.399 --> 34:01.079
he won't be able to do it.

34:02.960 --> 34:06.119
I don't think he's that easy to deceive.

34:07.959 --> 34:09.919
He'll definitely have some doubts.

34:10.280 --> 34:12.879
However, logically,

34:13.919 --> 34:16.979
there's no need for us
to risk sacrificing our family

34:16.999 --> 34:19.479
just to set the workshops on fire.

34:19.720 --> 34:20.959
We have no motive.

34:21.839 --> 34:23.959
Naturally, they won't
suspect the Ming family.

34:24.280 --> 34:25.620
This is impossible.

34:25.640 --> 34:26.899
If they were the culprits,

34:26.919 --> 34:28.700
their entire clan would be executed.

34:28.720 --> 34:30.620
Senior, the Ming family
isn't a bunch of fools.

34:30.640 --> 34:31.859
Why is it impossible?

34:31.879 --> 34:33.959
Your Highness, wealth can work wonders.

34:34.080 --> 34:36.399
But what has this
got to do with the fire?

34:40.830 --> 34:41.939
I'll use the black pieces.

34:41.959 --> 34:43.760
But why, Your Highness?

34:44.890 --> 34:46.280
Because you're a prince, huh?

34:46.760 --> 34:48.839
Fine. Let's see who goes first.

34:53.080 --> 34:55.660
I still think
that the fire was an accident.

34:55.680 --> 34:57.250
But I think the Ming family
was behind it.

34:57.270 --> 34:59.200
The Ming family has managed
the workshops for many years.

34:59.210 --> 35:00.359
Now that Sir is going to take over them,

35:00.359 --> 35:01.590
I'm sure they're unwilling
to hand them over.

35:01.600 --> 35:03.130
But Sir has already arrived in Jiangnan.

35:03.150 --> 35:05.220
No matter if they hand them over
or burn them down,

35:05.240 --> 35:07.110
they no longer
belong to the Ming family.

35:07.399 --> 35:08.560
Why would they take such a risk?

35:08.560 --> 35:10.280
They'll be executed for this, you know?

35:10.310 --> 35:11.240
What if the Ming family

35:11.240 --> 35:13.419
transported everything
from the warehouse to somewhere else?

35:13.439 --> 35:15.039
Does that make sense by then?

35:19.680 --> 35:20.760
Sir,

35:20.959 --> 35:21.819
I understand now.

35:21.839 --> 35:23.720
The Ming family set them
on fire on purpose.

35:23.730 --> 35:26.680
They wish to move the Three Great Workshops
elsewhere and monopolize them!

35:27.439 --> 35:29.260
How could anyone be so greedy

35:29.280 --> 35:30.819
as to harming that many lives?

35:30.839 --> 35:32.339
Isn't he afraid
of the laws of Qing State?

35:32.359 --> 35:33.439
That's the Ming family of Jiangnan.

35:33.439 --> 35:35.260
How could you think of them
as such evil individuals?

35:35.280 --> 35:37.100
Your Highness, it's not
that I think they're evil.

35:37.120 --> 35:38.419
People do die for the sake of money.

35:38.439 --> 35:39.700
That's human nature.

35:39.720 --> 35:40.859
You don't have any evidence.

35:40.879 --> 35:41.660
I don't trust you!

35:41.680 --> 35:42.499
I'm sure it's not real.

35:42.519 --> 35:43.599
It is real!

35:49.880 --> 35:51.519
Your Highness, you may not know,

35:52.080 --> 35:53.520
but that happened to me.

35:54.319 --> 35:55.399
My home,

35:56.039 --> 35:57.240
Shijia Town,

35:57.890 --> 35:59.840
it was burned to the ground
because of that.

36:01.359 --> 36:03.810
According to the disaster report
sent by the local magistrate,

36:03.830 --> 36:06.280
it stated that it was
an accidental fire due to dry weather.

36:07.319 --> 36:09.800
Your Highness, the entire town

36:10.800 --> 36:12.439
was wiped out.

36:14.039 --> 36:15.879
Don't you think they know how to escape?

36:16.439 --> 36:18.839
They concluded the case
by saying that it was an accident.

36:19.240 --> 36:20.479
I don't believe it.

36:22.519 --> 36:23.760
What do you think?

36:25.039 --> 36:26.559
Do you think it was an accident?

36:28.040 --> 36:29.559
Or was it a man-made accident?

36:43.160 --> 36:44.260
I'm sorry,

36:44.280 --> 36:45.360
Senior.

36:46.999 --> 36:48.200
I had no idea.

36:50.110 --> 36:51.359
Sorry about that.

36:51.560 --> 36:53.240
I've said something I shouldn't have.

37:07.439 --> 37:09.680
There are plenty of things
you don't know.

37:09.919 --> 37:11.519
Money can work wonders.

37:11.760 --> 37:14.320
It can also strip humans
of their human nature.

37:15.319 --> 37:17.559
How's the progress with Xie Bi'an?

37:17.600 --> 37:19.600
Xie Bi'an didn't suspect us either.

37:20.160 --> 37:22.959
After all, people have been saying

37:23.150 --> 37:24.920
that there was an internal struggle

37:25.560 --> 37:26.770
between us

37:26.790 --> 37:28.419
for the position
as the head of the family.

37:28.439 --> 37:29.800
But in reality,

37:30.399 --> 37:32.200
we're a pair of loving mother and son.

37:33.540 --> 37:35.680
I'm sure even
Eldest Princess wouldn't expect us

37:36.120 --> 37:38.200
to set up such a plot

37:39.800 --> 37:41.439
together.

37:45.959 --> 37:48.580
You must make sure
the incident site is safe.

37:48.600 --> 37:49.859
Don't worry.

37:49.879 --> 37:50.939
Even if they do investigate it,

37:50.959 --> 37:53.959
I'll point them
in the direction of Li Yunrui.

37:54.680 --> 37:55.839
After all,

37:56.080 --> 37:57.979
this is a conflict
between major figures.

37:57.999 --> 38:00.019
No one would care about

38:00.039 --> 38:01.680
merchants like us.

38:03.720 --> 38:05.080
People say

38:05.359 --> 38:08.240
that an ant hole may cause
the collapse of a great dike.

38:09.680 --> 38:11.039
But no one

38:13.200 --> 38:15.680
has even cared about the ants.

38:16.479 --> 38:18.039
In a few more days,

38:18.160 --> 38:19.419
the ships should...

38:19.439 --> 38:21.080
They're already ready.

38:21.760 --> 38:23.680
However, security has been tight lately.

38:23.800 --> 38:25.150
I dare not act recklessly.

38:25.680 --> 38:27.399
Once everything has settled down

38:28.080 --> 38:29.750
and Fan Xian returns to the palace,

38:29.959 --> 38:31.080
I'll arrange for the ships

38:31.100 --> 38:33.000
to transport the warehouse and personnel

38:33.319 --> 38:34.399
out to sea.

38:35.680 --> 38:37.459
Beware of man-made accidents.

38:37.479 --> 38:39.140
I bribed two of the managers.

38:39.160 --> 38:40.100
They thought

38:40.120 --> 38:42.640
Li Yunrui arranged for it to happen.

38:44.359 --> 38:45.479
The workers

38:45.720 --> 38:47.160
were obedient too.

38:47.640 --> 38:49.160
The dust will settle

38:51.080 --> 38:52.640
when the ships are out at sea.

38:55.120 --> 38:58.919
Seems like you no longer need me.

38:59.399 --> 39:03.160
You've made every arrangement yourself.

39:05.080 --> 39:07.120
Mother, it's all because
you taught me well.

39:07.399 --> 39:09.320
I claim no credit at all.

39:12.600 --> 39:14.120
My legs

39:15.160 --> 39:18.519
are getting worse.

39:20.439 --> 39:22.999
Seems like I'll be useless soon.

39:29.039 --> 39:31.320
Mother, how could you say that?

39:31.919 --> 39:33.919
Come. Let me carry you on my back.

39:50.039 --> 39:51.919
You're getting steadier

39:52.200 --> 39:54.720
as the head of the family.

39:58.999 --> 40:00.640
Mother, without your guidance,

40:01.040 --> 40:02.399
the head of the family

40:03.319 --> 40:04.919
is just an empty title.

40:06.120 --> 40:07.140
What do you guys think

40:07.160 --> 40:09.080
the most troublesome issue
in Jiangnan is?

40:09.919 --> 40:10.979
The Ming family.

40:10.999 --> 40:12.079
No.

40:14.359 --> 40:15.940
Eldest Princess and Second Prince.

40:15.960 --> 40:17.559
Actually, it's not them either.

40:18.120 --> 40:19.220
Who else can it be?

40:19.240 --> 40:19.879
Sometimes,

40:19.879 --> 40:21.330
the issue might not be an individual.

40:21.330 --> 40:22.270
It might be something like...

40:22.280 --> 40:23.360
Human nature?

40:24.310 --> 40:26.060
The Ming family dominated Jiangnan

40:26.080 --> 40:27.359
for many years.

40:27.360 --> 40:29.310
The other merchants have no chance
of making a profit.

40:29.330 --> 40:30.460
Although the Ming family is rich,

40:30.479 --> 40:34.439
poverty rate in all counties
will increase instead.

40:34.879 --> 40:36.740
That's why we should
make them step down.

40:37.400 --> 40:38.760
It's the same no matter who steps down.

40:38.780 --> 40:39.838
They'll become

40:39.839 --> 40:41.630
the new Ming family in just a few years.

40:44.120 --> 40:45.459
During my trip to the South,

40:45.479 --> 40:46.580
I heard this saying.

40:46.600 --> 40:48.630
Even if the Ming family doesn't exist,
there are other families.

40:48.640 --> 40:50.339
The Three Great Workshops
are treasure troves.

40:50.359 --> 40:51.339
The one in charge of them

40:51.359 --> 40:53.320
will be the next Ming family.

40:53.919 --> 40:57.100
Therefore, it doesn't matter
who owns the Three Great Workshops.

40:57.120 --> 40:58.859
What matters is its nature.

40:58.879 --> 41:00.039
What nature?

41:00.120 --> 41:02.940
The Three Great Workshops contains
the most profitable craftsmanship in the world.

41:02.959 --> 41:04.160
I know that.

41:04.720 --> 41:05.339
Glass,

41:05.359 --> 41:06.740
candy,

41:06.760 --> 41:08.290
cotton, and perfume.

41:08.310 --> 41:09.600
There's more to that.

41:09.760 --> 41:11.240
All of them are trade secrets.

41:11.359 --> 41:12.680
I wish to give them away.

41:14.560 --> 41:15.959
Give what away?

41:16.879 --> 41:18.560
I'll give away all the trade secrets

41:18.560 --> 41:20.160
of the Three Great Workshops.

41:21.839 --> 41:24.459
To who?

41:24.479 --> 41:25.519
To all the merchants in the world.

41:25.520 --> 41:27.170
They'll share the same technology.

41:27.980 --> 41:29.540
You'll sell them at an exorbitant price

41:29.560 --> 41:30.879
to cover the deficit.

41:33.800 --> 41:35.320
I will charge for them.

41:35.439 --> 41:37.090
But I'm not doing it
to cover the deficit.

41:37.110 --> 41:39.260
I didn't intend to sell them
at an exorbitant price either.

41:39.280 --> 41:41.160
All crafts have their own set prices.

41:41.160 --> 41:43.260
Merchants who wish to use them
need to pay every year.

41:43.280 --> 41:44.540
It's a long-term deal.

41:44.560 --> 41:47.479
This is what
we call as intellectual property rights.

41:52.280 --> 41:53.640
But this way,

41:53.720 --> 41:55.519
the Imperial Treasury's trade secrets

41:55.720 --> 41:56.580
will be gone too.

41:56.600 --> 41:57.499
But this way, the people

41:57.519 --> 41:59.479
will have hope.

41:59.560 --> 42:01.620
But the Imperial Treasury
belongs to the imperial family.

42:01.640 --> 42:04.600
Don't the people belong
to the imperial family as well?

42:06.919 --> 42:08.039
You...

42:09.160 --> 42:10.959
I guess you have a point.

42:12.959 --> 42:14.580
Creating intellectual property rights

42:14.600 --> 42:16.839
is the way to obtain true wealth.

42:16.840 --> 42:18.440
They shouldn't
be monopolized by one merchant

42:18.450 --> 42:20.220
or the imperial family.

42:20.240 --> 42:21.359
Instead,

42:21.480 --> 42:24.060
the world should progress together
and wealth should be shared.

42:24.080 --> 42:25.979
If this works out,

42:25.999 --> 42:28.680
maybe the people who are disregarded

42:29.200 --> 42:30.720
may be respected for once.

42:32.999 --> 42:34.080
Sir,

42:34.600 --> 42:36.880
regarding your statement
"wealth should be shared,"

42:37.080 --> 42:38.600
does Father know about it?

42:41.190 --> 42:42.300
I'll accomplish the task first.

42:42.319 --> 42:43.960
I'll tell him about it when I get back.

42:45.680 --> 42:46.690
Sir,

42:46.710 --> 42:48.419
I think we should
request his permission first.

42:48.439 --> 42:50.600
If you do it without his permission,

42:50.760 --> 42:52.359
I'm afraid Father will

42:52.959 --> 42:54.250
be enraged.

42:54.270 --> 42:55.580
If you wish to achieve great feats,

42:55.600 --> 42:57.280
you can't afford to be indecisive.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
